==Restrictions==
Unit Restriction: Only [[Cat Giraffe Modoki (Special Cat)|Cat Giraffe Modoki]], [[Catnip Tricky (Special Cat)|Catnip Tricky]] and [[Catnip Dragon (Special Cat)|Catnip Dragon]]

==Battleground==
*1 [[White Wind]] spawns.
*1 [[White Wind]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*1 [[White Wind]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*1 [[Red Wind]] (300%) spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Red Wind]] (300%) spawns after 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>.
*1 [[Red Wind]] (300%) spawns after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Red Wind]] (1%) spawns as the boss.
**5 [[White Wind]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**3 [[Red Wind]]s (300%) spawn, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
An easy stage. Even with the restriction of only using the [[JRA Collaboration Event|JRA Collaboration]] units, the enemies serve practically no threat at all. However, it is recommended to have them at least at level 1+7 so that they have some survivability.

